cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "vigiar: VIGIAR Environmental Health Data for Rio de Janeiro"
version: "0.7.1.9000"
authors:
  - family-names: Santos
    given-names: Ryan
    email: ryan.paulo@gsuite.iff.edu.br
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6770-2001"
repository-code: "https://github.com/santosry/vigiar"
url: "https://santosry.github.io/vigiar/"
abstract: >
  R package to download, process, validate, and audit environmental health
  surveillance data from Brazil's public VIGIAR Power BI dashboard, with
  explicit Rio de Janeiro municipality coverage, panel-completeness,
  truncation, schema, provenance, and reproducibility diagnostics. The package
  does not claim that the external source is complete and does not validate
  epidemiologic or causal inference.
keywords:
  - R
  - air-quality
  - PM2.5
  - public-health
  - epidemiology
  - Brazil
  - VIGIAR
  - Power-BI
  - environmental-health
  - reproducibility
  - data-audit
license: MIT
type: software
